"允","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0008"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001","quote":"允","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0031"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001","quote":"令度","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0033"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"字令度，朗弟、謝裕父；與宋52父允宣城內史同。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_A","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_siblings","sibling_assertion_ids":["a-nanshi019-yun-lang-younger"],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-jinshu079-xie-006"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001","quote":"謝裕字景仁，朗弟允之子、而晦從父也。名與宋武帝諱同，故以字行。允字令度，位宣城內史。景仁幼爲從祖安所知，始爲前軍行參軍，會稽王世子元顯嬖人張法順權傾一時，內外無不造門，唯景仁不至，年三十而方爲著作佐郎。桓玄誅元顯，見景仁，謂四坐曰：「司馬庶人父子雲何不敗，遂令謝景仁三十而方佐著作郎。」玄建楚臺，以補黃門侍郎。及篡位，領驍騎將軍。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0008","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0006","source_term":"朗弟允","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-yun-lang-younger"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-079","source_id":"s-jinshu-079-xielang-family","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-079-xielang-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-079-xielang-family:p003","quote":"朗字長度。父據，早卒。朗善言玄理，文義豔發，名亞于玄。總角時，病新起，體甚贏，未堪勞，于叔父安前與沙門支遁朗論，遂至相苦。其母王氏再遣信令還，安欲留，使竟論，王氏因出云：「新婦少遭艱難，一生所寄惟在此兒。」遂流涕攜朗去。安謂坐客曰：「家嫂辭情慷慨，恨不使朝士見之。」朗終於東陽太守。","source_term":"父據","source_assertion_id":"a-jinshu079-xie-006"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"具名兄弟句逐步連到其中一人的明父；父系為可撤回編輯組裝。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","raw_mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0008","c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0031","c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0033"],"paragraph_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0008","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0008"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0031","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0031"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0033","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0033"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":3,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":3,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"3處獨立位置，3個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-nanshi019-yu-yun-father","subject_person_id":"684_eaa_511","object_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AB","predicate":"father","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"允之子","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","bo